MBEDTLS 4 IN COSMOPOLITAN
=========================

This directory contains mbedTLS 4.1.0, vendored into the Cosmopolitan
repository. The upstream project is developed by the Mbed TLS contributors
and hosted at:

  https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls

The tf-psa-crypto/ subtree is the PSA Crypto API implementation, split from
the main mbedTLS repo upstream and re-integrated here as a git subtree:

  https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/TF-PSA-Crypto

License: Apache 2.0 (see LICENSE)


COSMOPOLITAN-SPECIFIC FILES
----------------------------

The following files are written and maintained by Cosmopolitan and are NOT
part of the mbedTLS upstream source. Do not delete them when updating the
upstream snapshot.

  BUILD.mk
      Cosmopolitan build system integration. Defines build targets,
      source lists, per-file CPPFLAGS, and dependency graph.

  README.txt  (this file)
      This document.

  clean.sh
      Script to remove all upstream mbedTLS source files, leaving only
      the Cosmopolitan-specific files listed here.

  include/mbedtls/mbedtls_config.h
      Cosmopolitan's configuration of mbedTLS features. This file
      overrides the upstream default config. It is NOT the upstream
      default; it has been customised to match what Cosmopolitan needs
      (e.g. MBEDTLS_DEBUG_C enabled, specific cipher suites).
      The canonical copy is embedded as a heredoc in update.sh — edit
      it there so it survives future upstream updates.

  include/mbedtls/platform.h
  include/mbedtls/private_access.h
      Cosmopolitan shim headers. These forward double-quote includes
      (e.g. #include "mbedtls/platform.h" in library sources) to the
      correct tf-psa-crypto paths, allowing mkdeps to resolve them via
      the -S third_party/mbedtls4/include/ search path. They are not
      upstream files — do not overwrite them with upstream content.
      update.sh recreates them if missing.


UPSTREAM MBEDTLS SOURCE DIRECTORIES
-------------------------------------

Everything below is unmodified upstream mbedTLS source. Use update.sh
to refresh these to a new version.

  generated/          Header wrappers generated automatically by the build
                      via build/mkmbedtls4wrappers.py. Safe to delete —
                      recreated on the next make run.

  3rdparty/           Third-party code bundled by mbedTLS upstream
  BRANCHES.md         Upstream branch policy
  BUGS.md             Upstream bug reporting guide
  ChangeLog           Upstream changelog
  ChangeLog.d/        Upstream per-PR changelog fragments
  cmake/              CMake build system files (not used by Cosmopolitan)
  CMakeLists.txt      CMake entry point (not used by Cosmopolitan)
  configs/            Alternate mbedTLS configuration presets
  CONTRIBUTING.md     Upstream contribution guide
  DartConfiguration.tcl  CTest configuration (not used by Cosmopolitan)
  dco.txt             Developer Certificate of Origin
  docs/               Upstream architecture and design documentation
  doxygen/            Doxygen configuration for API docs
  framework/          Upstream test infrastructure (mbedtls-framework submodule).
                      Not downloaded by update.sh — only needed for mbedtls's
                      own test suite, which Cosmopolitan does not build.
  include/mbedtls/    Public mbedTLS SSL/X.509 headers
                      (except mbedtls_config.h — see above)
  library/            SSL and X.509 C implementation files
  LICENSE             Apache 2.0 license
  pkgconfig/          pkg-config templates (not used by Cosmopolitan)
  programs/           Upstream example and utility programs
                      (not built by Cosmopolitan)
  README.md           Upstream README
  scripts/            Upstream helper scripts (code generation, etc.)
  SECURITY.md         Upstream security policy
  SUPPORT.md          Upstream support policy
  tests/              Upstream test suite (not built by Cosmopolitan)
  tf-psa-crypto/      PSA Crypto API implementation subtree
    ChangeLog.d/
    cmake/
    configs/
    core/             PSA crypto core C sources
    dispatch/
    docs/
    drivers/          Builtin PSA driver (the main crypto implementation)
      builtin/include/mbedtls/  Internal/private headers
      builtin/src/              C implementation files
    doxygen/
    extras/           Optional PSA extras (e.g. Everest / Curve25519)
    framework/
    include/mbedtls/  PSA-era public mbedTLS headers (md.h, pk.h, etc.)
    include/psa/      PSA Crypto API public headers
    pkgconfig/
    platform/         Platform abstraction layer
    programs/
    scripts/
    tests/
    utilities/        PSA utility sources


UPDATING THE UPSTREAM SNAPSHOT
--------------------------------

1. Run: ./third_party/mbedtls4/update.sh <version>
   This removes old upstream files, downloads and unpacks the new tarball,
   and restores mbedtls_config.h from the embedded heredoc.
2. Review include/mbedtls/mbedtls_config.h for any new upstream config options.
3. Run a full clean build — generated/ wrappers are recreated automatically:
     make clean && make -j$(nproc)
